  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.8.191",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.191\n\nReleased on 2026-10-24.\n\nA deleted layer that a script still looks up now stays hidden instead of coming back, and a script that throws no longer blocks a render. Preview loads only the clips due next, so it holds up on slow links.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Studio:** Motion blur panel with Off / Subtle / Strong ([ffc327b44](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ffc327b44c548576bb40be2eef14bc04d7694d6f), [#6112](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6112)).\n- **CLI:** Check writes a progress line to stderr per sample, overlap batch and craft frame ([55cbc0e15](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/55cbc0e158b38e25cc240f9b45d13f69c498a823), [#6151](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6151)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** Exclude rendering flags from tween tail warnings ([84e6dfd24](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/84e6dfd2477db4d54056459b6d4202ee10824402), [#5711](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5711)).\n- **Engine:** Redraw a small drawElement frame before failing the serial capture ([c478110be](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c478110be79c0c3fe60237ec42d1389fa9771bca), [#5748](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5748)).\n- **Core:** Preview fetches only the clips due next, and drops passed clips still downloading ([179098936](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/179098936faaa21fd2bf74dfa80b4e705fdb3c65), [#6160](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6160)).\n- **Core:** A hidden child of a mover stays out of the blur trail ([e077d9dc7](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e077d9dc7468ebaa63d2985977ae7da525446086), [#6155](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6155)).\n- **Sdk:** A kept delete drops its media sources and a hidden video is not waited for ([44100a537](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/44100a53702e474687f1c68e23e31b995c7c8c12), [#6163](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6163)).\n- **Studio:** Audio clips in the timeline share the video clip corner radius ([579f73bf2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/579f73bf29df3f4b4f5d0d6f95f1d3bd47869ede), [#6159](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6159)).\n- **CLI:** Snapshot waits for the image layers a seek reveals before capturing ([1552f52fb](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1552f52fbe9313f9323f08c4401e83ea11857ec9), [#6161](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6161)).\n- **Engine:** A composition whose script throws is skipped with a warning, not refused ([8df9b6dd3](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8df9b6dd3b3720308ac42cda6158454f55d9bcee), [#6156](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6156)).\n- **Sdk:** A stored delete a script still looks up is hidden when overrides replay, not removed ([dad825945](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/dad8259457ca8fbf40a5f6d3910da7a88cfa0773), [#6143](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6143)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **AWS Lambda:** A render reads a video's audio from a small file stored beside it ([3439433d6](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3439433d676f8440272621f9a1a453aa9b123294), [#6162](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6162)).\n\n## Docs & Examples\n\n- **CLI:** Apply review notes from #5442 to open, timeline and history ([fb8aadad1](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/fb8aadad1713309be1ba8c2e3d65d37e892b2af4), [#6110](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6110)).\n- **Skills:** Remove duplicated sections in skill references ([d5526bd48](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d5526bd48025890d39c1a1a8f7eb6823a1277b86), [#6164](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6164)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Engine:** Only h264 is held to identical bytes across host sizes ([19cc96e3f](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/19cc96e3f29337cfe1ed655121c8c48d8b310f86), [#6167](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6167)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.190...v0.8.191\n"
}
